title: "PP-SPEC-033: Proof of Efficacy Mapping to the NIST AI Risk Management Framework"
abstract: >-
  Maps Proof Protocol proof-of-efficacy metrics and evidence to the outcomes
  defined in NIST AI 100-1 (AI RMF 1.0), with alignment to state independent
  verification frameworks in Connecticut, California, Virginia, and Colorado.
